    "chunk_text": "his on twa healfe & \u00dea awrat Pilatus sum gewrit & het on \u00f0a rode gen\u00e6glian wi\u00f0ufan his heafod. W\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6ron awriten: Iesus Nazarenus, Res Iudeorum. Her is ahangen se Nazarenisca H\u00e6lend, se is Iudea Cyning. \u00deis gewrit r\u00e6ddan m\u00e6nige Iudea, for \u00f0an seo stow w\u00e6s neah \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre \u00fe\u00e6r he ahangen w\u00e6s. W\u00e6s hit awriten on \u00f0reo ge\u00f0eodu, on Ebreisc & on L\u00e6den & on Grecisc. \u00dea cw\u00e6don Iudea ealdormen to Pilate, Ne writ \u00f0u \u00e6\u00fet gewrit swa \u00fe\u00e6t he sy Iudea Cyning, ac \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Pilatus: Quod scripsi scripsi, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fe\u00e6r wrat, \u00fe\u00e6t sceal beon awriten. \u00dea genamon \u00fea c\u00e6mpan, sy\u00f0\u00f0an hi hine ahangen h\u00e6fdon, his hr\u00e6gl & hit on feower tod\u00e6ldan. Feng \u00e6lc to his d\u00e6le, buton his tunecan anre. Seo w\u00e6s syllice geworht; n\u00e6s na gesiwed ac w\u00e6s eall on an gewefen. \u00dea cw\u00e6don hi, Ne slitan we \u00feas tunecan, ac uton hleoton hwilc ure hi age. W\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t to \u00f0an swa gedon \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00fe\u00e6t gewrit sceolde beon gefylled \u00fee be \u00f0an awriten w\u00e6s: Diuiserunt Heo tod\u00e6ldan him min hr\u00e6gl & hi s\u00e6ndon hlott ofer mine gegyrlan. \u00dea stod \u00fe\u00e6r big \u00fe\u00e6re rode Maria his lichamlice moder, & hire swuster Maria Cleophe, & \u00feonne gyt Mid \u00fey \u00f0e se H\u00e6lend \u00fe",
